From 9311a20753e1dae6e198959502f3109ca42bb1a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Season Tempo Build <claude@seasontempo.local>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 18:56:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] Import Players and player contacts

Import
  Name is required and cannot be cleared; other columns stay optional.
  Matching candidates are now organization-wide on both sides. The preview was
  given the season roster while the server evaluated the whole organization, so
  a player in the organization but not on this roster was invisible to the
  browser and visible to the server, and the coach saw Create for a row the
  server would match. One shared query now feeds both.
  Runs record which columns were mapped and what each row decided.

Contacts
  A guardian holding only an email could not be removed: the confirmation was
  keyed on a possibly-null id, so 'null === null' rendered it unprompted, and
  confirming sent the string "null" to a uuid column.
  Legacy parent_* no longer resurrects a deleted guardian. The backfill covered
  every eligible player, so a player with no contacts has none by choice.
  Manual editing clears deliberately; import keeps blank-no-erase, because an
  import cannot see what it would overwrite and a coach can.
